    <h2>Where Garland equipment lives across LA</h2>
    <p>Garland concentrates in five distinct LA operator clusters. Each has a characteristic equipment profile.</p>

    <h3 class="line-h3">DTLA hotel banquet kitchens — Master Series + MCO convection + Hotel Pan Holding</h3>
    <p>The DTLA luxury hotel cluster (JW Marriott LA Live, Ritz-Carlton DTLA, InterContinental, Conrad, Westin Bonaventure) runs Garland in banquet prep configurations. Master Series ranges and US Range heavy-duty units handle high-volume cook lines. MCO-GS-20 double-stack convection handles bulk baking and roasting. Hotel Pan Holding cabinets carry production through to banquet service. We dispatch to this cluster regularly; multi-piece Garland service calls are normal here.</p>

    <h3 class="line-h3">Beverly Hills and West Hollywood steakhouse cluster — Sentry G-series + GS Charbroilers</h3>
    <p>The LA steakhouse market is the densest Garland install base in the city. Mastro's (Beverly Hills, Newport Beach), STK group kitchens, Ruth's Chris (Beverly Hills, Pasadena), Wolfgang's Steakhouse, Capital Grille, Nick + Stef's DTLA — Sentry G-series gas ranges plus Charbroilers GS-series infrared. Detail on these pages lives on our <a href="/brands/garland-range-repair/">Garland Range combo</a>.</p>

    <h3 class="line-h3">LAUSD and institutional — Sentry + griddles + Hotel Pan Holding</h3>
    <p>School district central kitchens, Caltech dining operations, hospital food service. Sentry G-series ranges + gas griddles for breakfast service + Hotel Pan Holding for service-line transport. We service institutional Garland across Cedars-Sinai, UCLA Health, Huntington Hospital production kitchens.</p>

    <h3 class="line-h3">Diner / brunch / casual — Griddles + GD Charbroilers</h3>
    <p>Mid-LA diner format operations and brunch-heavy concepts run Garland griddles in 24-inch through 48-inch configurations. GD radiant charbroilers serve burger concepts and casual grill programs. Lower brand visibility than the steakhouse cluster but consistent install base across Mid-City, Hollywood, Long Beach.</p>

    <h3 class="line-h3">Catering and banquet operations — MCO convection + Hotel Pan Holding</h3>
    <p>LA's high-volume catering operations (Patina Restaurant Group, Wolfgang Puck Catering, full-service event caterers) run MCO double-stack convection plus Hotel Pan Holding for production-then-hold-then-transport-then-serve workflows. The MCO + Holding combination is the catering operational backbone in this segment.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── ALI GROUP SIBLING CALL ── -->
