    <h2>One service account, Garland + Frymaster + Manitowoc + Beverage-Air + Champion + Lincoln</h2>
    <p>The Ali Group acquisition of Welbilt put Garland into the same parent foodservice portfolio as a long list of LA-relevant commercial brands. For operators running multi-Ali kitchens — extremely common in hotel banquet builds, steakhouse operations, and dealer-spec turnkey installations — that opens up an operational pattern that wasn't available pre-2022: one service relationship covering the full sibling list. (Note: Pitco, the other major commercial fryer brand, is NOT in this list. Pitco is part of Middleby Corporation via the Blodgett 1981 acquisition chain. We service Pitco too, but the parts pipeline runs through Middleby distribution rather than Ali Group NA.)</p>
    <p>Our Ali Group sibling coverage spans:</p>
    <ul class="check-list">
      <li><strong>Garland + US Range</strong> — direct sibling under Ali, shared parts pipeline. Range coverage on <a href="/brands/garland-range-repair/">Garland Range combo</a>.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/brands/frymaster-fryer-repair/">Frymaster fryers</a></strong> — Ali Group McDonald's-OEM fryer sibling.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/brands/manitowoc/">Manitowoc Ice</a></strong> — Ali Group commercial ice machine pillar.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/brands/beverage-air/">Beverage-Air</a></strong> — Ali Group back-bar and commercial refrigeration sibling.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/brands/champion-dishwasher-repair/">Champion dishwashers</a></strong> — Ali Group commercial dishwasher sibling.</li>
      <li><strong>Lincoln conveyor pizza ovens</strong> — Ali Group commercial cooking sibling (Lincoln Impinger conveyor pizza ovens).</li>
      <li><strong>Convotherm combi ovens, Kolpak walk-ins, Master-Bilt and Nor-Lake walk-in refrigeration, Delfield commercial refrigeration</strong> — all Ali Group siblings, all serviced through the same parts pipeline.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>For a hotel banquet operator running Garland Master Series ranges + Frymaster fryers + Manitowoc ice machines + Beverage-Air back-bar refrigeration, that's one phone call to one service account covering four Ali Group brands. Mom-and-pop service providers typically specialize in one or two brands; multi-Ali coverage is structurally the territory of dedicated multi-brand commercial service operations like ours.</p>
  </div>
